    "delivery": "reply",
    "message": "VA1 has a serious application problem: at Oct 15, 20:20 UTC, ingress monitoring showed Arena returning 5xx on 94.2% of requests, despite its allocation running without restarts. The alert feed also reported 78 Duel dead-letter arrivals in the last hour. Their causes remain unexplained; the available reads did not expose diagnostic logs or traces.\n\nThe underlying infrastructure looks available: Nomad reports 5/5 clients ready, Cassandra 3/3 normal, and PostgreSQL monitoring 9/9 targets up. Backup monitoring reports successful backups, though restores weren’t verified. Other measured services had 0% ingress 5xx except Ladder at 0.375%.\n\nCan you provide access to Arena’s error logs and Duel’s consumer/dead-letter logs, or share a failing request trace and a dead-letter message error?",
